# CODEOWNERS for sdd-forge
#
# This config is live. @aharada54914 is the repository owner
# (github.com/aharada54914/sdd-forge), not a placeholder — the four rules below
# are in effect today and require that owner's approval to merge changes under
# the paths they name.
#
# Coverage — exactly four paths are owned:
#   /plugins/sdd-quality-loop/scripts/     gate scripts and guards
#   /plugins/sdd-quality-loop/references/  gate reference data
