# changes to it need no CODEOWNERS approval. Adding a catch-all would change
# approval requirements repository-wide; treat it as a deliberate policy
# decision, not a cleanup.
#
# Known coverage gaps, noted for future consideration (NOT currently owned —
# listing them here does not grant ownership):
#   /plugins/sdd-quality-loop/hooks/  /contracts/  /mcp/  /install.sh
#   /install.ps1  /tests/validate-repository.ps1  /plugins/sdd-review-loop/agents/
#
# Optional future change: the individual handle could be swapped for a team slug
# (e.g., @sdd-forge/maintainers) to spread review load. This is not a
# prerequisite for anything below — the current handle works as written.

# Security-critical: quality-loop gate scripts and guards
